00:40.220" end="00:40.550">our </span><span begin="00:40.550" end="00:41.870">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.900" end="00:44.240"><span begin="00:41.900" end="00:42.140">You </span><span begin="00:42.140" end="00:42.440">killed </span><span begin="00:42.440" end="00:42.560">the </span><span begin="00:42.560" end="00:43.250">beauty </span><span begin="00:43.250" end="00:44.090">of </span><span begin="00:44.090" end="00:44.240">today</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.240" end="00:46.160"><span begin="00:44.240" end="00:45.500">Forever </span><span begin="00:45.500" end="00:46.070">and </span><span begin="00:46.070" end="00:46.160">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.160" end="00:47.900"><span begin="00:46.160" end="00:46.610">Life </span><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:46.820">is </span><span begin="00:46.820" end="00:47.090">now </span><span begin="00:47.090" end="00:47.240">or </span><span begin="00:47.240" end="00:47.900">never</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.930" end="00:50.150"><span begin="00:47.930" end="00:48.590">Forever </span><span begin="00:48.590" end="00:49.040">never </span><span begin="00:49.040" end="00:49.700">comes </span><span begin="00:49.700" end="00:50.150">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.590" end="01:01.640"><span begin="00:57.590" end="00:57.830">You'll </span><span begin="00:57.830" end="00:58.250">never </span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:58.610">see </span><span begin="00:58.610" end="00:58.910">me </span><span begin="00:58.910" end="01:01.640">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.670" end="01:04.910"><span begin="01:01.670" end="01:01.940">So </span><span begin="01:01.940" end="01:02.360">now </span><span begin="01:02.360" end="01:02.480">who's </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.870">gonna </span><span begin="01:02.870" end="01:03.410">cry </span><span begin="01:03.410" end="01:03.620">for </span><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:04.910">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.970" end="01:09.290"><span begin="01:04.970" end="01:05.240">You'll </span><span begin="01:05.240" end="01:05.660">never </span><span begin="01:05.660" end="01:05.960">see </span><span begin="01:05.960" end="01:06.290">me </span><span begin="01:06.290" end="01:09.290">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.320" end="01:12.020"><span begin="01:09.320" end="01:09.620">No </span><span begin="01:09.620" end="01:10.100">matter </span><span begin="01:10.100" end="01:10.400">what </span><span begin="01:10.400" end="01:10.550">you </span><span begin="01:10.550" end="01:12.020">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.290" end="01:16.370"><span begin="01:12.290" end="01:12.620">You'll </span><span begin="01:12.620" end="01:13.010">never </span><span begin="01:13.010" end="01:13.370">see </span><span begin="01:13.370" end="01:13.670">me </span><span begin="01:13.670" end="01:16.370">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.400" end="01:19.730"><span begin="01:16.400" end="01:16.730">So </span><span begin="01:16.730" end="01:17.120">now </span><span begin="01:17.120" end="01:17.240">who's </span><span begin="01:17.240" end="01:17.630">gonna </span><span begin="01:17.630" end="01:18.170">cry </span><span begin="01:18.170" end="01:18.380">for </span><span begin="01:18.380" end="01:19.730">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.760" end="01:24.050"><span begin="01:19.760" end="01:20.000">You'll </span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.390">never </span><span begin="01:20.390" end="01:20.750">see </span><span begin="01:20.750" end="01:21.080">me </span><span begin="01:21.080" end="01:24.050">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.080" end="01:26.990"><span begin="01:24.080" end="01:24.410">No </span><span begin="01:24.410" end="01:24.860">matter </span><span begin="01:24.860" end="01:25.190">what </span><span begin="01:25.190" end="01:25.340">you </span><span begin="01:25.340" end="01:26.990">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.280" end="01:41.150"><span begin="01:37.280" end="01:37.550">You </span><span begin="01:37.550" end="01:38.030">never </span><span begin="01:38.030" end="01:38.540">heard </span><span begin="01:38.540" end="01:38.720">me </span><span begin="01:38.720" end="01:39.260">break </span><span begin="01:39.260" end="01:39.560">your </span><span begin="01:39.560" end="01:41.150">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.150" end="01:44.630"><span begin="01:41.150" end="01:41.330">You </span><span begin="01:41.330" end="01:41.690">didn't </span><span begin="01:41.690" end="01:42.110">wake </span><span begin="01:42.110" end="01:42.410">up </span><span begin="01:42.410" end="01:43.160">when </span><span begin="01:43.160" end="01:43.370">we </span><span begin="01:43.370" end="01:44.630">died</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.660" end="01:48.380"><span begin="01:44.660" end="01:45.050">Since </span><span begin="01:45.050" end="01:45.200">I </span><span begin="01:45.200" end="01:45.440">was </span><span begin="01:45.440" end="01:46.040">lonely </span><span begin="01:46.040" end="01:46.580">from </span><span begin="01:46.580" end="01:46.910">the </span><span begin="01:46.910" end="01:48.380">start</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.410" end="01:51.530"><span begin="01:48.410" end="01:48.650">I </span><span begin="01:48.650" end="01:48.920">think </span><span begin="01:48.920" end="01:49.160">the </span><span begin="01:49.160" end="01:49.430">end </span><span begin="01:49.430" end="01:49.760">is </span><span begin="01:49.760" end="01:50.540">mine </span><span begin="01:50.540" end="01:50.750">to </span><span begin="01:50.750" end="01:51.530">write</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.530" end="01:52.610"><span begin="01:51.530" end="01:51.800">Forever </span><span begin="01:51.800" end="01:51.980">and </span><span begin="01:51.980" end="01:52.610">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.610" end="01:54.230"><span begin="01:52.610" end="01:53.060">Life </span><span begin="01:53.060" end="01:53.300">is </span><span begin="01:53.300" end="01:53.570">now </span><span begin="01:53.570" end="01:53.690">or </span><span begin="01:53.690" end="01:54.230">never</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.380" end="01:56.630"><span begin="01:54.380" end="01:55.070">Forever </span><span begin="01:55.070" end="01:55.490">never </span><span begin="01:55.490" end="01:56.150">comes </span><span begin="01:56.150" end="01:56.630">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.630" end="01:59.270"><span begin="01:56.630" end="01:57.410">People </span><span begin="01:57.410" end="01:58.010">love </span><span begin="01:58.010" end="01:58.190">and </span><span begin="01:58.190" end="01:58.640">let </span><span begin="01:58.640" end="01:59.270">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.270" end="02:00.380"><span begin="01:59.270" end="01:59.640">Forever </span><span begin="01:59.640" end="02:00.010">and </span><span begin="02:00.010" end="02:00.380">ever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.380" end="02:01.790"><span begin="02:00.380" end="02:00.500">Life </span><span begin="02:00.500" end="02:00.680">is </span><span begin="02:00.680" end="02:00.950">now </span><span begin="02:00.950" end="02:01.070">or </span><span begin="02:01.070" end="02:01.790">never</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.790" end="02:04.040"><span begin="02:01.790" end="02:02.540">Forever's </span><span begin="02:02.540" end="02:02.810">gonna </span><span begin="02:02.810" end="02:03.380">slow </span><span begin="02:03.380" end="02:03.590">you </span><span begin="02:03.590" end="02:04.040">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.070" end="02:08.090"><span begin="02:04.070" end="02:04.310">You'll </span><span begin="02:04.310" end="02:04.730">never </span><span begin="02:04.730" end="02:05.060">see </span><span begin="02:05.060" end="02:05.360">me </span><span begin="02:05.360" end="02:08.090">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.120" end="0